INFO 2026-05-21 02:36:48,309 chat_sync.sync [request_id=923B4E26-744D-447E-94B2-C30A58F71DAF] chat push payload request_id=923B4E26-744D-447E-94B2-C30A58F71DAF user_id=4 content_type=application/json body={"messages":[{"thread_id":"8943ce62-4def-4bd2-b622-bcc1ce3b6300","role":"assistant","model_name":"deepseek-v4-pro","client_message_id":"4fe4a299-fa58-471b-892e-4df8eae1fea8","delivery_state":"pending","created_at":"2026-05-21 02:35:53.314000+00:00","server_updated_at":"2026-05-21 02:36:47.517000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"deepseek-v4-pro","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":14096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}","blocks":[{"revision":1779331007487548,"order_key":2000,"id":"E69BB762-1794-5E55-B1B2-247C5A6C543B","updated_at":"2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z","status":"ready","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"name":"generate_structured_health_card","content":"[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}},"kind":"tool","node_role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_GpTWQPFeySLvoudTVMXU4289","created_at":"2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z"},{"revision":1779331003987278,"anchor":{"value":"call_00_2N1AsfXa6OsxQAhsmzVa5271","type":"toolCall"},"order_key":2100,"id":"BA45B676-3726-5C23-B389-B1DBE718AB99","updated_at":"2026-05-21T02:36:43.000Z","status":"ready","payload":{"knowledge_cards":{"_0":[{"title":"处方：普拉洛芬滴眼液+盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（结膜炎）","content":"## 处方信息\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| 医院 | 苏州大学附属第四医院 |\n| 门诊号 | 0000349056 |\n| 姓名 | 赵道凯 |\n| 性别 | 男 |\n| 年龄 | 27岁 |\n| 科室 | 皮肤科门诊 |\n| 诊断 | 结膜炎 |\n| 日期 | 2026年4月20日 |\n\n---\n\n## 药品明细\n\n### 药品一\n- **名称**：普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）\n- **规格**：5ml:5mg\n- **用法用量**：滴眼，每天4次，每次1滴\n- **数量**：1盒\n\n### 药品二\n- **名称**：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\n- **规格**：6ml:3mg（0.05%）\n- **用法用量**：滴眼，每天2次，每次1滴\n- **数量**：1盒\n- **提示**：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\n\n---\n\n## 用药提醒\n\n- 普拉洛芬为**非甾体抗炎药**，用于缓解眼部炎症；盐酸氮卓斯汀为**抗组胺药**，用于缓解过敏症状\n- 两种滴眼液如需同时使用，建议间隔**5-10分钟**\n- 滴眼前洗净双手，瓶口勿接触眼睛或皮肤\n- 盐酸氮卓斯汀开封后**4周内**用完，过期丢弃","id":"3DEC4CB0-2D94-AB92-11AD-CD6F669120E8","shows_save_and_copy":true}]}},"kind":"knowledgeCards","node_role":"toolPresentation","tool_call_id":"call_00_2N1AsfXa6OsxQAhsmzVa5271","created_at":"2026-05-21T02:36:43.000Z"},{"revision":1779331007516693,"order_key":4000,"id":"D242E369-EB8B-5074-8FD6-4DA3A5B3D398","updated_at":"2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z","status":"ready","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"name":"create_knowledge_document","content":"已生成知识库文档草稿「处方：普拉洛芬滴眼液+盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（结膜炎）」，内容已附在消息内知识卡中，用户可点击保存到知识库。"}}},"kind":"tool","node_role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_2N1AsfXa6OsxQAhsmzVa5271","created_at":"2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z"},{"id":"7F722253-CBA4-5DA4-A25F-AF03DAE60041","created_at":"2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z","payload":{"text":{"_0":"已为您生成处方知识卡，包含两种滴眼液的用法用量和关键提醒。您可以点击卡片保存到知识库，方便随时查阅。"}},"order_key":5000,"node_role":"timeline","kind":"text","status":"ready","revision":1779331007486284,"updated_at":"2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z"}]}],"block_updates":[]}
