"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"丙氨酸氨基转移酶(ALT)\",\"result_value\":\"14.6\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"总蛋白(TP)\",\"result_value\":\"77.0\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"白蛋白(ALB)\",\"result_value\":\"47.4\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"球蛋白(GLOB)\",\"result_value\":\"29.6\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"白球比(A\\/G)\",\"result_value\":\"1.6\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"γ-谷氨酰转移酶(GGT)\",\"result_value\":\"19.9\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"碱性磷酸酶(ALP)\",\"result_value\":\"75.9\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"前白蛋白(PA)\",\"result_value\":\"287.0\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肾功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"尿素(UREA)\",\"result_value\":\"5.14\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肾功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"肌酐(CREA)\",\"result_value\":\"77.50\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肾功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"尿酸(UA)\",\"result_value\":\"324.6\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肾功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"胱抑素C(CysC)\",\"result_value\":\"0.76\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血糖\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"葡萄糖(GLU)\",\"result_value\":\"5.42\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"心肌酶\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"肌酸激酶(CK)\",\"result_value\":\"104.3\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"心肌酶\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"乳酸脱氢酶(LDH)\",\"result_value\":\"168.0\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"心肌酶\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"α-羟丁酸脱氢酶(HBDH)\",\"result_value\":\"140.4\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"肝功能\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"胆碱酯酶(CHE)\",\"result_value\":\"11124\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血脂\",\"diagnosis\":\"适宜\",\"item_name\":\"甘油三酯(TG)\",\"result_value\":\"0.70\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血脂\",\"diagnosis\":\"适宜\",\"item_name\":\"总胆固醇(TC)\",\"result_value\":\"5.07\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血脂\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"高密度脂蛋白胆固醇(HDL-C)\",\"result_value\":\"1.51\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血脂\",\"diagnosis\":\"增高\",\"item_name\":\"低密度脂蛋白胆固醇(LDL-C)\",\"result_value\":\"3.51\",\"sort_order\":null}],\"doctor\":\"\",\"hospital\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）\",\"title\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）检验报告单\"}"}],"medical_cases":[],"medications":[],"prescriptions":[]}}},"tool_call_id":"call_00_DaAwBix8QA32YocZkYD32565","parent_block_id":"101837BD-BF06-5DF2-91AE-0082FFF52122","anchor":{"value":"call_00_DaAwBix8QA32YocZkYD32565","type":"toolCall"},"order_key":2100,"revision":1779341041630436,"id":"6729E4B4-5E58-55D2-AAA3-2F6C75420AE7","node_role":"toolPresentation","updated_at":"2026-05-21T05:24:01.630Z","kind":"structuredHealthCards"},{"payload":{"text":{"_0":"---\n\n## 第二份：生化检验报告（血脂+肝肾功能等）"}},"status":"ready","id":"99CCA7B8-93EE-5222-990E-7FBB6870BC7B","order_key":3000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z","revision":1779341016283132,"updated_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z","kind":"text","node_role":"timeline"},{"status":"ready","node_role":"tool","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。","name":"generate_structured_health_card"}}},"order_key":4000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.232Z","revision":1779341016377675,"updated_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.378Z","tool_call_id":"call_00_DaAwBix8QA32YocZkYD32565","kind":"tool","id":"101837BD-BF06-5DF2-91AE-0082FFF52122"},{"status":"ready","node_role":"timeline","payload":{"text":{"_0":"---\n\n## 第三份：门诊用药单（结膜炎）"}},"order_key":5000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z","revision":1779341016284610,"updated_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z","kind":"text","id":"99CCA6B8-93EE-506F-990E-7EBB6870BAC8"},{"status":"ready","node_role":"tool","payload":{"tool":{"_0":{"content":"[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。","name":"generate_structured_health_card"}}},"order_key":6000,"created_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.232Z","revision":1779341016447603,"updated_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.448Z","tool_call_id":"call_00_wpDpRdsYnJRyNLiO1kyK3975","kind":"tool","id":"FE7E307B-AE3F-5C0D-8050-27DB6FDC5A8F"},{"order_key":7000,"status":"ready","created_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z","kind":"text","payload":{"text":{"_0":"---\n\n## ✅ 三份报告已生成健康卡片，汇总如下：\n\n| 序号 | 卡片类型 | 来源 | 日期 | 核心内容 |\n|------|----------|------|------|----------|\n| 1 | **检查报告** | 胃镜诊断报告 | 2026-02-10 | 慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流 |\n| 2 | **检查报告** | 生化检验（血脂+肝肾） | 2025-12-28 | 肝肾功能、血糖、心肌酶均正常；**LDL-C 3.51 mmol/L 边缘升高**，需关注 |\n| 3 | **用药处方** | 皮肤科/结膜炎 | 2026-04-20 | 普拉洛芬滴眼液 qid + 氮卓斯汀滴眼液 bid |\n\n---\n\n### 🔔 特别提醒：\n\n- **低密度脂蛋白（LDL-C）3.51 mmol/L** 已超出理想范围（<2.60），属于边缘升高。虽然总胆固醇尚在适宜范围，但建议结合心血管风险因素（如家族史、血压、体重等）咨询心内科或内分泌科，评估是否需要生活方式干预或药物治疗。\n- **慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流** 需注意饮食规律、避免暴饮暴食、少食辛辣油腻，必要时消化内科随访。\n- 结膜炎用药注意：氮卓斯汀滴眼液开封后 **4周内用完**，超期不可再用。"}},"id":"99CCA5B8-93EE-5EBC-990E-7DBB6870B915","updated_at":"2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z","node_role":"timeline","revision":1779341016316152}]}],"block_updates":[]}
