：若有病理，请于3-5个工作日后在手机公众号上查询及去一楼或五楼的自助报告机取报告！","file_md5":"b549c88052b52d02e02867117b763749"}]}},"created_at":"2026-05-21T05:28:15.635Z","status":"ready","updated_at":"2026-05-21T05:28:15.635Z","id":"85C334F6-E53E-40EA-A05C-79A2E4B90F08","kind":"imageGallery","revision":1,"node_role":"timeline"},{"payload":{"text":{"_0":"好的，我将为你提炼这两份报告的关键信息，并分别生成对应的健康卡片。\n每一份报告生成前 需要表面标题"}},"created_at":"2026-05-21T05:28:15.635Z","status":"ready","updated_at":"2026-05-21T05:28:15.635Z","id":"AB760095-D0B6-496E-B915-128AF8DF14E5","kind":"text","revision":1,"node_role":"timeline"}]}],"block_updates":[]}
