kanounonishi, Sajji，\n5少\nFukusakicho, Kanzaki-gun, Hyogo-ken,Japan\n门诊号","type":"image"}]}},"created_at":"2026-05-21T08:37:49.894Z","id":"087A6B6E-3509-472F-8B8D-03046CC58A06","kind":"imageGallery","updated_at":"2026-05-21T08:37:49.894Z","status":"ready"},{"revision":1,"node_role":"timeline","status":"ready","created_at":"2026-05-21T08:37:49.894Z","kind":"text","payload":{"text":{"_0":"药品和报告抽取\n不要任何解读 只调用 结构化工具就行"}},"updated_at":"2026-05-21T08:37:49.894Z","id":"6A6BCAE3-7DBB-4CA9-B288-7F8240242CD5"}]}],"block_updates":[]}
